- Append 0: go to state 0 from any state, weight 1.
- Append 1: go from state j to j+1 for j < W, weight H.

The transition matrix T thus has size (W+1) x (W+1):
- T[0][c] = 1 for all c in [0..W] (append 0)
- T[r+1][r] += H for r in [0..W-1] (append 1)

